# The UR arm meshes the cuRobo descriptors build from, pinned as the upstream commit holds them. Fetched and checked
# by fetch_ur_meshes.py, which writes git's blob bytes, so a checkout's line endings never change a pin.
# Source: https://github.com/UniversalRobots/Universal_Robots_ROS2_Description at commit 89bbe795f38a7ab00fb66fe8831dfff79dc99edf (2026-07-20).
# Licence: BSD-3-Clause, Universal Robots; the source and licence cuRobo's own ur_description/LICENSE names.
# Paths are relative to <cuRobo content>/assets/robot/ur_description. Every arm's collision meshes are pinned; ur16e
# takes base, shoulder and wrists from ur10e. Visual meshes are pinned for the arms cuRobo does not ship: its own ur5e
# and ur10e visuals are another revision (one line apart at wrist3.dae) and stay cuRobo's.
